    <briefdescription>
<para>Heuristic ProTeGi provider that operates without an LLM. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The critique is derived from keyword analysis of the error strings. Candidate prompts are generated by appending structured improvement guidance based on the critique. Useful for integration tests. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
